 "section_summary": "This section comprises introductory text, classification charts, statistical summary tables, and an institutional roster for educational institutions in Ehime Prefecture in 1946, compiled by the Civil Information and Education Section (CIE) of GHQ/SCAP in cooperation with the Japanese Ministry of Education. It begins with an overview of national, public, and private control jurisdictions in Japanese education, accompanied by twelve prefecture-level summary tables detailing school counts, student enrollments, and teaching staff as of April and November 1946. The remainder of the section presents a comprehensive roster listing individual higher, secondary, elementary, and youth schools across Ehime Prefecture, recording each institution's address, founding date, enrollment, and faculty numbers.",
 "subfiles": [
