   "start_page": 109,
   "summary": "This official report, prepared by the Civil Information and Education Section (CIE) of GHQ/SCAP in cooperation with the Japanese Ministry of Education, compiles comprehensive data on educational institutions in Ehime Prefecture as of 1946. It outlines the structure of national, public, and private educational control and presents twelve detailed statistical tables summarizing school numbers, enrollments, and teaching personnel as of 30 April and 30 November 1946. The report then provides an exhaustive roster listing every institution by level and administrative jurisdiction, providing founding dates, addresses, gender breakdown of enrollments, and teacher counts.",
   "title": "Roster of Japanese Educational Institutions: Ehime Prefecture",
